1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,960
(Leonard:)Hey, pretty lady.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,690
(Penny:)You seem extra happy.

3
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:08,410
(Leonard:)- I guess I am.
- Any particular reason why?

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,490
No, just having a good day.

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:13,170
(Leonard:)This morning Sheldon fell asleep
on the way to work...

6
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,640
(Leonard:)...so I got to listen to the radio.
That was crazy.

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,800
Mm-hm. Anything else?

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,010
(Leonard:)Mm... I found this quiz online called
"Which Star Trek Character Are You?"

9
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,530
(Leonard:)It only took me four tries
to get Captain Kirk. Heh.

10
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,530
- That's great.
- Oh.

11
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,280
(Leonard:)It. Was.

12
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,690
(Penny:)Hmm.
I'm glad you're having such a great day.

13
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:37,640
(Leonard:)And the one thing that could make it
better is an evening with my special girl.

14
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:38,850
(Penny:)Oh, and who's that?

15
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:40,530
(Leonard:)What do you mean?

16
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:43,160
(Penny:)I just didn't know if you meant me
or Alex.

17
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,210
(Leonard:)Why would I mean Alex?

18
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:48,050
(Penny:)Because I know she hit on you
and I know you liked it!

19
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,480
(Leonard (jumping and knocking over the Jenga):)What?

20
00:00:52,160 --> 00:01:01,020
(Penny:)Don't play dumb with me,
Ricardo Shilly-Shally!

